::X|EN|gr.recall.policy.del.001|  What it is      : The three WindowsAI policy values and the
::X|EN|gr.recall.policy.del.002|                    WSAIFabricSvc start type, approached from the restore
::X|EN|gr.recall.policy.del.003|                    menu. Recall periodically captures the screen and
