::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.080|                    mapping of the numeric SubscribedContent IDs to
::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.081|                    specific Settings surfaces is from community
::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.082|                    documentation, not from Microsoft, and the IDs have
::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.083|                    been observed to move between builds.
::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.084|
::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.085|  Target          : reg delete on HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentV
::X|EN|gr.cdm.suggestions.restore.086|                    ersion\ContentDeliveryManager for
