::X|FR|gr.spotlight.policy.del.071|
::X|FR|gr.spotlight.policy.del.072|  Cible           : reg delete "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Policies\Microsoft\Windows\C
::X|FR|gr.spotlight.policy.del.073|                    loudContent" /v "DisableWindowsSpotlightFeatures" /f
