:: ---- db.advertisingid.off (preference) ------------------------------
::P|db.advertisingid.off|0|0|0|0|1|
::T|EN|db.advertisingid.off.001|TURN OFF THE ADVERTISING ID
::T|EN|db.advertisingid.off.002|Stops apps from getting a personal ad-tracking ID from Windows - you will still see ads, just less targeted ones, with no effect on speed, memory or battery.
::T|FR|db.advertisingid.off.001|DESACTIVER L IDENTIFIANT DE PUBLICITE
::T|FR|db.advertisingid.off.002|Empeche les applis de recevoir un identifiant de suivi publicitaire de Windows : vous verrez toujours des pubs, juste moins ciblees, sans effet sur la vitesse, la memoire ou la batterie.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.001|  What it is      : A resettable per-user identifier that Store apps read
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.002|                    through the Windows Advertising API to key personalised
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.003|                    advertising.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.004|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.005|  Actual effect   : Writes 0 for the current user, so the API returns nothing
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.006|                    usable.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.007|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.008|  Gain            : Ads in Store apps stop being aimed at a profile built from
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.009|                    your activity - that is the entire effect. Nothing else
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.010|                    changes: no speed, memory or network difference, because
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.011|                    nothing is running either way.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.012|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.013|  Cost            : You will not see fewer ads, only less relevant ones.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.014|                    Nothing breaks.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.015|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.016|  Windows default : 1, present and enabled.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.017|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.018|  Possible values:
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.019|    1      : Apps get a real advertising ID from the Windows Advertising API -
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.020|             a stable per-user key they can use to link your activity across
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.021|             apps and sessions. This is what a fresh profile ships with.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.022|    0      : The API hands back an empty identifier. Apps lose the OS-provided
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.023|             key; they can still show ads and can still build their own
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.024|             identifiers. No CPU, memory or network difference either way -
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.025|             this is a targeting switch, not a performance one.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.026|    DELETE : Absent behaves exactly as 1, so deleting cannot be used to switch
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.027|             it off. Both directions of this setting therefore write an
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.028|             explicit value.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.029|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.030|  Why these profiles : Four profiles write 0 and there is no honest difference
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.031|                       between them to report - gaming latency, server
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.032|                       throughput and laptop battery are all completely
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.033|                       indifferent to this value, so the only question anyone
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.034|                       is answering is whether they want the OS handing out a
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.035|                       stable tracking key, and on a machine you own the
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.036|                       answer is no. Office does not get its usual features-on
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.037|                       exemption here, because ad targeting is not a feature a
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.038|                       user loses. Only the Windows row writes 1, and note
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.039|                       that it has to write it: absence means enabled, so
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.040|                       there is no delete-your-way-out on this one.
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.041|
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.042|  Target             : reg add "HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.043|                       \AdvertisingInfo" /v "Enabled" /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f
::X|EN|db.advertisingid.off.044|                       (OPTY.bat line 1729)
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.001|  Ce que c est   : Un identifiant reinitialisable, propre a l utilisateur, que
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.002|                   les applications du Store lisent via l API publicitaire de
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.003|                   Windows pour cibler la publicite.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.004|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.005|  Effet reel     : Ecrit 0 pour l utilisateur courant : l API ne renvoie plus
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.006|                   rien d exploitable.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.007|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.008|  Gain           : Les publicites des applications du Store cessent de viser
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.009|                   un profil construit a partir de votre activite - c est tout
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.010|                   l effet. Rien d autre ne change : aucune difference de
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.011|                   vitesse, de memoire ou de reseau, puisque rien ne tourne
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.012|                   dans un cas comme dans l autre.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.013|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.014|  Cout           : Vous ne verrez pas moins de pubs, seulement des pubs moins
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.015|                   pertinentes. Rien ne casse.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.016|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.017|  Defaut Windows : 1, presente et activee.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.018|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.019|  Valeurs possibles :
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.020|    1      : Les applications obtiennent un veritable identifiant publicitaire
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.021|             via l API publicitaire de Windows : une cle stable, propre a l
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.022|             utilisateur, qui leur permet de relier votre activite entre
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.023|             applications et entre sessions. C est ce que contient un profil
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.024|             neuf.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.025|    0      : L API renvoie un identifiant vide. Les applications perdent la
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.026|             cle fournie par le systeme ; elles peuvent toujours afficher des
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.027|             pubs et se fabriquer leurs propres identifiants. Aucune
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.028|             difference de CPU, de memoire ou de reseau dans un sens comme
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.029|             dans l autre : c est un interrupteur de ciblage, pas de
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.030|             performance.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.031|    DELETE : Absente, la valeur se comporte exactement comme 1 : la supprimer
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.032|             ne permet donc pas de la desactiver. Les deux sens de ce reglage
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.033|             ecrivent par consequent une valeur explicite.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.034|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.035|  Pourquoi ces profils : Quatre profils ecrivent 0, et il n y a entre eux
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.036|                         aucune difference honnete a signaler : la latence en
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.037|                         jeu, le debit d un serveur et l autonomie d un
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.038|                         portable sont totalement indifferents a cette valeur.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.039|                         La seule question posee est de savoir si l on veut
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.040|                         que le systeme distribue une cle de suivi stable, et
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.041|                         sur une machine qui vous appartient la reponse est
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.042|                         non. La bureautique ne beneficie pas ici de son
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.043|                         exemption habituelle fonctions actives, parce que le
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.044|                         ciblage publicitaire n est pas une fonction que l
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.045|                         utilisateur perd. Seule la ligne Windows ecrit 1, et
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.046|                         remarquez qu elle doit l ecrire : l absence vaut
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.047|                         activation, donc impossible de s en sortir par une
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.048|                         suppression.
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.049|
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.050|  Cible                : reg add "HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersi
::X|FR|db.advertisingid.off.051|                         on\AdvertisingInfo" /v "Enabled" /t REG_DWORD /d 0 /f
