:: ---- reg.dragfullwindows (preference) -------------------------------
::P|reg.dragfullwindows|1|0|1|1|1|
::T|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.001|WINDOW CONTENTS WHILE DRAGGING
::T|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.002|Shows just an outline instead of the full window while you drag it - on a real GPU this changes nothing measurable, it only helps over Remote Desktop or a GPU-less display path.
::T|FR|reg.dragfullwindows.001|CONTENU DES FENETRES PENDANT LE DEPLACEMENT
::T|FR|reg.dragfullwindows.002|Affiche un simple contour au lieu du contenu complet pendant le deplacement d une fenetre - sur un vrai GPU cela ne change rien de mesurable, cela n aide qu en Bureau a distance ou sur un affichage sans GPU.
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.001|  What it is      : DragFullWindows, a REG_SZ under HKCU\Control
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.002|                    Panel\Desktop, decides whether you see a window's actual
