::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.007|                    moving the composited window surface at every mouse
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.008|                    position.
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.009|
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.010|  Gain            : On modern hardware, none you can measure. Window dragging
