::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.012|                    mechanism is still real is a display path with no GPU
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.013|                    acceleration at all - RDP over a slow link, or a VM on a
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.014|                    basic display adapter - where the outline is a fraction of
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.015|                    the pixels.
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.016|
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.017|  Cost            : Dragging becomes visually crude: you cannot see what you
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.018|                    are positioning until you release. Snap layouts, window
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.019|                    previews and Aero Snap are unaffected.
