::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.033|        installed.
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.034|
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.035|  Why these profiles : Three profiles say 1 because on a machine with a real
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.036|                       GPU this setting buys nothing and costs you the ability
::X|EN|reg.dragfullwindows.037|                       to see what you are positioning. Server is the
