::X|FR|file.self.update.092|                      checksum. Whether the releases asset still ships LF-
::X|FR|file.self.update.093|                      only today was measured once, on the version quoted
::X|FR|file.self.update.094|                      in the code comments; GitHub could change that at
::X|FR|file.self.update.095|                      any time, which is precisely why the script
::X|FR|file.self.update.096|                      normalises rather than trusting the server.
::X|FR|file.self.update.097|
::X|FR|file.self.update.098|  Cible           : OPTY.bat :update_opty / :update_found_and_accepted
::X|FR|file.self.update.099|                    (lines 218-305): curl -f -L -o "%~dp0new_OPTY.bat"
