::X|EN|storagesense.enable.068|                       a deliberate off, which is a third position, not
::X|EN|storagesense.enable.069|                       the default.
::X|EN|storagesense.enable.070|
::X|EN|storagesense.enable.071|  Known problems  : Turning the master switch on inherits this machine's
::X|EN|storagesense.enable.072|                    existing Recycle Bin rule. StoragePolicy values 08
