:: ---- storagesense.downloads.off (repair) ------------------------
::P|storagesense.downloads.off|0|0|0|0|0|
::T|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.001|KEEP AUTO-DELETE OFF FOR YOUR DOWNLOADS FOLDER
::T|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.002|This makes sure Storage Sense can never automatically delete files in your Downloads folder, protecting installers, invoices or torrents you meant to keep, with no downside since this is already the Windows default.
::T|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.001|GARDER LA SUPPRESSION AUTOMATIQUE DESACTIVEE POUR TELECHARGEMENTS
::T|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.002|Ceci garantit que l Assistant Stockage ne pourra jamais supprimer automatiquement les fichiers du dossier Telechargements, protegeant installateurs, factures ou torrents que vous vouliez garder, sans aucun inconvenient puisque c est deja la valeur par defaut de Windows.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.001|  What it is      : Storage Sense has a separate rule that can delete
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.002|                    files in your Downloads folder once they reach a
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.003|                    chosen age. It is off by default, but a previous
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.004|                    tweaking tool or a curious click can have armed it.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.005|                    This step forces both halves of it off.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.006|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.007|  Actual effect   : Writes StoragePolicy values 32=0 and 512=0 - 'do not
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.008|                    clean Downloads' and 'age threshold: never'. Both are
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.009|                    the shipped values, so on an untouched machine this is
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.010|                    a re-assert; on a machine where either was armed it is
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.011|                    a genuine repair.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.012|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.013|  Gain            : It guarantees that turning Storage Sense on in the
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.014|                    step above cannot inherit an already-armed Downloads
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.015|                    rule. Without this pin, OPTY would be the thing that
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.016|                    started deleting your downloads a month later - which
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.017|                    is the concrete failure this whole card exists to
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.018|                    prevent.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.019|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.020|  Cost            : Nothing. This is a pure safety measure and it is the
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.021|                    Windows default anyway. You can still turn Downloads
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.022|                    cleanup on yourself in Settings > System > Storage >
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.023|                    Storage Sense if you actually want it.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.024|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.025|  Windows default : 32=0 and 512=0 - Downloads auto-delete is off, age
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.026|                    threshold 'Never'. Writing 0 here is the shipped
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.027|                    value, not a third state.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.028|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.029|  Possible values:
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.030|    32=0                 : Downloads cleanup rule off. Storage Sense never
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.031|                           looks inside %USERPROFILE%\Downloads. This is
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.032|                           the shipped value and the one OPTY writes for
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.033|                           every profile.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.034|    32=1                 : Downloads cleanup rule armed. During each
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.035|                           scheduled pass, files in the Downloads folder
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.036|                           that have not been opened for longer than the
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.037|                           threshold in value 512 are deleted permanently
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.038|                           - not moved to the Recycle Bin. This is the
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.039|                           setting that eats installers, invoices and
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.040|                           torrents people were keeping on purpose.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.041|    512=0                : Age threshold 'Never'. Paired with 32=0 it is
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.042|                           belt and braces: even if something later flips
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.043|                           32 to 1, a threshold of Never means no file is
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.044|                           old enough to qualify.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.045|    512=1 / 14 / 30 / 60 : Age threshold in days. Anything non-zero here
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.046|                           is live ammunition the moment value 32 becomes
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.047|                           1: 512=1 means a file you downloaded yesterday
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.048|                           and have not reopened is deleted on the next
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.049|                           pass.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.050|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.051|  Why these profiles : Five identical answers, and that is the entire
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.052|                       point of the card: this is a guard rail, not a
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.053|                       preference. There is no machine role - gaming,
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.054|                       hosting, office, portable - for which unattended
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.055|                       permanent deletion of the Downloads folder is the
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.056|                       right behaviour, and WINDOWS agrees because 0 is
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.057|                       what Windows ships. A profile split here would mean
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.058|                       one of the five profiles deliberately arming a
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.059|                       data-loss rule, which none of them should.
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.060|
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.061|  Target          : HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Storage
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.062|                    Sense\Parameters\StoragePolicy /v "32" /t REG_DWORD
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.063|                    and /v "512" /t REG_DWORD - OPTY.bat lines 897-898,
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.064|                    call :regset "%SSP%" "32" REG_DWORD 0 and call :regset
::X|EN|storagesense.downloads.off.065|                    "%SSP%" "512" REG_DWORD 0
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.001|  Ce que c est    : L Assistant Stockage possede une regle separee capable
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.002|                    de supprimer les fichiers de votre dossier
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.003|                    Telechargements passe un certain age. Elle est
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.004|                    desactivee par defaut, mais un ancien outil
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.005|                    d optimisation ou un clic curieux a pu l armer. Cette
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.006|                    etape force ses deux moities sur OFF.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.007|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.008|  Effet reel      : Ecrit les valeurs StoragePolicy 32=0 et 512=0, soit «
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.009|                    ne pas nettoyer Telechargements » et « seuil d age :
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.010|                    jamais ». Ce sont les valeurs d origine : sur une
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.011|                    machine intacte c est une reaffirmation, sur une
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.012|                    machine ou l une des deux etait armee c est une vraie
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.013|                    reparation.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.014|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.015|  Gain            : Ca garantit qu activer l Assistant Stockage a l etape
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.016|                    precedente ne peut pas heriter d une regle
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.017|                    Telechargements deja armee. Sans ce verrou, OPTY
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.018|                    serait la cause de la disparition de vos
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.019|                    telechargements un mois plus tard - c est exactement
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.020|                    l incident que cette fiche existe pour empecher.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.021|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.022|  Cout            : Rien. C est une pure mesure de securite, et c est de
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.023|                    toute facon la valeur par defaut de Windows. Vous
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.024|                    pouvez toujours activer vous-meme le nettoyage des
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.025|                    Telechargements dans Parametres > Systeme > Stockage >
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.026|                    Assistant Stockage si vous y tenez.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.027|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.028|  Defaut Windows  : 32=0 et 512=0 - la suppression automatique des
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.029|                    Telechargements est desactivee, seuil d age « Jamais
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.030|                    ». Ecrire 0 ici, c est la valeur livree, pas une
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.031|                    troisieme position.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.032|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.033|  Valeurs possibles :
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.034|    32=0                 : Regle de nettoyage des Telechargements
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.035|                           desactivee. L Assistant Stockage ne regarde
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.036|                           jamais dans %USERPROFILE%\Telechargements.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.037|                           C est la valeur d origine et celle qu OPTY
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.038|                           ecrit pour tous les profils.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.039|    32=1                 : Regle de nettoyage des Telechargements armee. A
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.040|                           chaque passage planifie, les fichiers du
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.041|                           dossier Telechargements qui n ont pas ete
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.042|                           ouverts depuis plus longtemps que le seuil de
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.043|                           la valeur 512 sont supprimes definitivement -
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.044|                           pas envoyes a la Corbeille. C est le reglage
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.045|                           qui devore les installateurs, les factures et
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.046|                           les torrents que les gens gardaient exprès.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.047|    512=0                : Seuil d age « Jamais ». Associe a 32=0, c est
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.048|                           ceinture et bretelles : meme si quelque chose
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.049|                           remet 32 a 1 plus tard, un seuil « Jamais »
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.050|                           signifie qu aucun fichier n est assez vieux
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.051|                           pour etre eligible.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.052|    512=1 / 14 / 30 / 60 : Seuil d age en jours. Toute valeur non nulle
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.053|                           ici est une munition chargee des l instant ou
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.054|                           la valeur 32 passe a 1 : 512=1 signifie qu un
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.055|                           fichier telecharge hier et jamais rouvert
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.056|                           disparait au passage suivant.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.057|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.058|  Pourquoi ces profils : Cinq reponses identiques, et c est toute la
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.059|                         raison d etre de la fiche : c est un garde-fou,
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.060|                         pas une preference. Il n existe aucun role de
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.061|                         machine - jeu, hebergement, bureautique, mobilite
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.062|                         - pour lequel la suppression definitive et
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.063|                         automatique du dossier Telechargements soit le
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.064|                         bon comportement, et WINDOWS est d accord puisque
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.065|                         0 est la valeur livree. Une distinction entre
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.066|                         profils voudrait dire qu un des cinq arme
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.067|                         deliberément une regle de perte de donnees, ce
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.068|                         qu aucun ne devrait faire.
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.069|
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.070|  Cible           : HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Storage
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.071|                    Sense\Parameters\StoragePolicy /v "32" /t REG_DWORD
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.072|                    and /v "512" /t REG_DWORD - OPTY.bat lines 897-898,
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.073|                    call :regset "%SSP%" "32" REG_DWORD 0 and call :regset
::X|FR|storagesense.downloads.off.074|                    "%SSP%" "512" REG_DWORD 0
