:: ---- power.throttling.off (preference) ------------------------------
::P|power.throttling.off|DELETE|1|DELETE|DELETE|DELETE|
::T|EN|power.throttling.off.001|DISABLE POWER THROTTLING (ECOQOS)
::T|EN|power.throttling.off.002|Stops Windows from slowing down background processes to save power - speeds up background work like compiling or downloading, but does not raise game FPS, and costs more heat, fan noise and battery life.
::T|FR|power.throttling.off.001|FORCAGE GLOBAL DU POWER THROTTLING (ECOQOS)
::T|FR|power.throttling.off.002|Empeche Windows de ralentir les processus d arriere-plan pour economiser l energie - accelere les taches de fond comme une compilation ou un telechargement, mais n augmente pas les FPS en jeu, et coute plus de chaleur, de bruit et d autonomie.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.001|  What it is      : Power Throttling is the Windows feature that spots
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.002|                    processes doing unimportant background work and runs
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.003|                    them slowly and cheaply - on efficiency cores, in low
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.004|                    clock states. It is what stops a minimised browser tab
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.005|                    draining your battery. PowerThrottlingOff=1 turns the
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.006|                    whole mechanism off machine-wide, for every process at
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.007|                    once. It is a blunt global switch; the supported way
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.008|                    to exempt one program is the per-app 'Do not allow
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.009|                    power optimizations' setting.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.010|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.011|  Actual effect   : Writes PowerThrottlingOff=1 under HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentC
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.012|                    ontrolSet\Control\Power\PowerThrottling. From then on
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.013|                    nothing is clocked down for being background work.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.014|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.015|  Gain            : Background and minimised work stops being slowed down:
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.016|                    a compile, an encode, a game-launcher patch download,
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.017|                    a headless service. That is a real mechanism and the
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.018|                    only substantiated one. What it does NOT do is raise
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.019|                    your frame rate - the game in front of you was never
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.020|                    the process being throttled, so there is nothing there
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.021|                    to un-throttle. No measurable FPS gain, on any
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.022|                    hardware.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.023|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.024|  Cost            : More power draw, more heat, louder fans. On a laptop,
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.025|                    noticeably shorter battery life, and on a thermally
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.026|                    limited chassis it can end up slower, because more
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.027|                    heat means the CPU hits its thermal limit earlier. And
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.028|                    on a gaming desktop it works against you: it is
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.029|                    precisely what lets Search indexing, a Defender scan
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.030|                    and a Store update all run at full clocks in the
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.031|                    middle of your session, competing with the game for
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.032|                    cores.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.033|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.034|  Windows default : The value is absent, which means Power Throttling is
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.035|                    ENABLED and Windows decides per process.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.036|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.037|  Possible values:
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.038|    1                    : Power Throttling (EcoQoS) is switched off
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.039|                           machine-wide. Every process may request full
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.040|                           frequency and full-size cores, whether it is
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.041|                           the window in front of you or a background
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.042|                           service. Concretely: Search indexing, Defender
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.043|                           scans, Store updates, OneDrive sync and a
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.044|                           minimised encoder all run at full clocks, all
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.045|                           the time, including while you are gaming.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.046|    0                    : Throttling explicitly enabled. Mechanically
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.047|                           identical to the value being absent - Windows
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.048|                           classifies processes itself and runs the
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.049|                           background ones on efficiency cores at low
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.050|                           clock states. The difference from absent is
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.051|                           cosmetic: 0 is a third state in the registry
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.052|                           that a factory machine does not have.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.053|    DELETE               : Value absent - the shipped state. Power
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.054|                           Throttling is enabled and Windows decides per
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.055|                           process, modulated by the Settings power-mode
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.056|                           slider. This is what you want unless you have a
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.057|                           specific reason.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.058|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.059|  Why these profiles : Exactly one profile writes 1, and it is not the one
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.060|                       people expect. Server is the only machine where
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.061|                       everything worth running is, by Windows'
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.062|                       definition, background work: a torrent client, a
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.063|                       Plex transcode and a game server have no foreground
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.064|                       window to be measured against, so EcoQoS can slow
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.065|                       down the entire reason the box exists. It is on
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.066|                       mains, latency does not matter, throughput does -
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.067|                       that is the one honest case for 1. Gaming gets
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.068|                       DELETE, deliberately against the folklore: your
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.069|                       game was never throttled, and disabling the
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.070|                       mechanism only unleashes Defender and Search at
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.071|                       full clocks while you play. Office and Laptop get
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.072|                       DELETE for the obvious reasons: quiet, cool, and
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.073|                       battery. Windows gets DELETE because absent is the
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.074|                       shipped state, and note that writing 0 would be a
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.075|                       third state, not a restoration.
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.076|
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.077|  Target          : HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Power\PowerThrot
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.078|                    tling /v PowerThrottlingOff (REG_DWORD) - OPTY.bat
::X|EN|power.throttling.off.079|                    line 1517 writes 1 in the gaming-profile block
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.001|  Ce que c est    : Le Power Throttling est la fonction de Windows qui
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.002|                    repere les processus faisant du travail de fond sans
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.003|                    importance et les execute lentement et a moindre cout
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.004| - sur les coeurs d efficacite, a basse frequence.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.005| C est ce qui empeche un onglet de navigateur reduit de
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.006|                    vider votre batterie. PowerThrottlingOff=1 coupe tout
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.007|                    le mecanisme sur la machine entiere, pour tous les
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.008| processus d un coup. C est un interrupteur global
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.009| brutal ; la maniere prevue d exempter un seul
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.010|                    programme est le reglage par application « Ne pas
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.011| autoriser les optimisations d alimentation ».
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.012|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.013|  Effet reel      : Ecrit PowerThrottlingOff=1 sous HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentCon
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.014|                    trolSet\Control\Power\PowerThrottling. Des lors, plus
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.015| rien n est ralenti au motif que c est du travail
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.016| d arriere-plan.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.017|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.018| Gain : Le travail d arriere-plan et reduit cesse d etre
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.019|                    ralenti : une compilation, un encodage, le
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.020| telechargement d un correctif par un launcher, un
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.021| service sans interface. C est un mecanisme reel, et le
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.022| seul qui soit etaye. Ce que ca ne fait PAS, c est
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.023| augmenter vos FPS : le jeu devant vous n a jamais ete
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.024| le processus bride, il n y a donc rien a debrider.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.025|                    Aucun gain de FPS mesurable, sur aucun materiel.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.026|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.027|  Cout            : Plus de consommation, plus de chaleur, des
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.028|                    ventilateurs plus bruyants. Sur un portable, une
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.029|                    autonomie nettement reduite, et sur un chassis limite
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.030|                    thermiquement ca peut finir plus lent : plus de
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.031| chaleur, c est la limite thermique atteinte plus tot.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.032| Et sur un fixe de jeu, ca joue contre vous : c est
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.033| exactement ce qui laisse l indexation, une analyse
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.034|                    Defender et une mise a jour du Store tourner a pleine
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.035|                    frequence au milieu de votre partie, en concurrence
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.036|                    avec le jeu pour les coeurs.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.037|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.038|  Defaut Windows  : La valeur est absente, ce qui signifie que le Power
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.039|                    Throttling est ACTIVE et que Windows decide processus
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.040|                    par processus.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.041|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.042|  Valeurs possibles :
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.043|    1                    : Le Power Throttling (EcoQoS) est coupe sur
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.044|                           toute la machine. Chaque processus peut
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.045|                           reclamer la pleine frequence et les gros
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.046| coeurs, qu il soit la fenetre devant vous ou un
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.047| service d arriere-plan. Concretement :
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.048| l indexation, les analyses Defender, les mises
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.049|                           a jour du Store, la synchro OneDrive et un
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.050|                           encodeur reduit tournent tous a pleine
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.051|                           frequence, en permanence, y compris pendant que
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.052|                           vous jouez.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.053|    0                    : Bridage explicitement active. Mecaniquement
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.054|                           identique a la valeur absente : Windows classe
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.055|                           lui-meme les processus et fait tourner ceux
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.056| d arriere-plan sur les coeurs d efficacite, a
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.057| basse frequence. La difference avec l absence
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.058|                           est cosmetique : 0 est un troisieme etat dans
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.059| le registre qu une machine d usine n a pas.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.060| DELETE : Valeur absente - l etat livre. Le Power
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.061|                           Throttling est actif et Windows decide
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.062|                           processus par processus, module par le curseur
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.063| de mode d alimentation des Parametres. C est ce
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.064|                           que vous voulez, sauf raison precise.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.065|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.066| Pourquoi ces profils : Un seul profil ecrit 1, et ce n est pas celui
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.067| auquel on s attend. Serveur est la seule machine
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.068|                         ou tout ce qui merite de tourner est, au sens de
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.069| Windows, du travail d arriere-plan : un client
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.070|                         torrent, un transcodage Plex et un serveur de jeu
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.071| n ont aucune fenetre au premier plan a laquelle
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.072|                         se comparer, donc EcoQoS peut ralentir la raison
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.073| meme d exister de la machine. Elle est sur
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.074|                         secteur, la latence est sans importance, le debit
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.075| compte : c est le seul cas honnete pour 1. Gaming
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.076|                         recoit DELETE, volontairement a contre-courant du
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.077| folklore : votre jeu n a jamais ete bride, et
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.078|                         couper le mecanisme ne fait que lacher Defender
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.079| et l indexation a pleine frequence pendant que
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.080|                         vous jouez. Bureau et Portable recoivent DELETE
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.081|                         pour les raisons evidentes : silence, fraicheur,
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.082|                         autonomie. Windows recoit DELETE parce que
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.083| l absence est l etat livre - et notez qu ecrire 0
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.084|                         serait un troisieme etat, pas une restauration.
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.085|
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.086|  Cible           : HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Power\PowerThrot
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.087|                    tling /v PowerThrottlingOff (REG_DWORD) - OPTY.bat
::X|FR|power.throttling.off.088|                    line 1517 writes 1 in the gaming-profile block
