::X|EN|rad.pwr.idledisable.062|                       workstation is the only machine with a real
::X|EN|rad.pwr.idledisable.063|                       argument for 1, and it is not one of the five
::X|EN|rad.pwr.idledisable.064|                       profiles here, so pretending one of them stands in
::X|EN|rad.pwr.idledisable.065|                       for it would be inventing a distinction. Windows
