::X|FR|helper.pwrfix.129|
::X|FR|helper.pwrfix.130|  Cible           : :pwrfix at OPTY.bat lines 3485-3517, with :pwrread at
::X|FR|helper.pwrfix.131|                    lines 3477-3483. Called three times, at lines 1906 /
