::X|EN|reg.gamedvr.enabled.036|                           counter, the widgets, the audio mixer all still
::X|EN|reg.gamedvr.enabled.037|                           open.
::X|EN|reg.gamedvr.enabled.038|    1                    : The shipped value: capture is available.
::X|EN|reg.gamedvr.enabled.039|                           Available is the operative word - it means the
::X|EN|reg.gamedvr.enabled.040|                           hook can arm, not that anything is recording.
::X|EN|reg.gamedvr.enabled.041|                           What decides whether recording actually happens
