::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.023|
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.024|  Possible values:
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.025|    autotuninglevel=normal :
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.026|        Restores automatic receive-window scaling after the reset has
