::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.033|                           shipped state.
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.034|    heuristics=enabled or default :
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.035|        Enabled lets Windows override your level silently; default hands
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.036|        the decision to the built-in policy, which is disabled.
