::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.039|        to one, default hands the choice back to Windows.
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.040|
::X|EN|net.tcp.globals.assert.postreset.041|  Why these profiles : Five identical columns, and this one is barely a
