::X|EN|recycle.bin.all.drives.025|                    files, not your deleted documents, so there is no
::X|EN|recycle.bin.all.drives.026|                    rollback of any kind. And because the sweep is part of
::X|EN|recycle.bin.all.drives.027|                    the auto path today, an unattended Auto full run
::X|EN|recycle.bin.all.drives.028|                    performs it without asking: empty and check your
::X|EN|recycle.bin.all.drives.029|                    Recycle Bin yourself before starting one.
::X|EN|recycle.bin.all.drives.030|
