::T|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.001|CHECK DISK HEALTH (ONLINE SCAN)
::T|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.002|Reads your disk to check for filesystem errors while Windows keeps running - it only reports problems, fixes nothing on the spot and never slows the machine down, so a clean result is the normal outcome.
::T|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.001|VERIFIER LA SANTE DU DISQUE (ANALYSE EN LIGNE)
::T|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.002|Lit le disque pour verifier les erreurs de systeme de fichiers pendant que Windows continue de tourner - cela ne fait que signaler les problemes, ne repare rien sur le moment et ne ralentit jamais la machine, un resultat propre est donc normal.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.001|  What it is      : chkdsk C: /scan checks the NTFS filesystem structures
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.002|                    while Windows is running. It does not lock the volume,
