::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.010|
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.011|  Gain            : You learn whether your filesystem is healthy, and that
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.012|                    is the whole of it - this is a report, not a repair. A
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.013|                    clean result here is the expected result, because
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.014|                    Windows already runs an equivalent self-heal
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.015|                    continuously through the Spot Verifier service and the
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.016|                    ProactiveScan maintenance task.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.017|
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.018|  Cost            : A few minutes of time and disk I/O. Nothing else, on
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.019|                    any drive type. It is entirely safe on SSDs - there is
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.020|                    no surface scan and no write.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.021|
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.022|  Windows default : Not applicable as a setting - Windows performs
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.023|                    continuous online self-healing on its own, and this
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.024|                    step configures nothing.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.025|
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.026|  Possible values:
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.027|    RUN                  : chkdsk C: /scan. Walks the NTFS metadata
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.028|                           online, without locking the volume and without
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.029|                           a reboot. It repairs nothing on the spot:
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.030|                           anything it finds is written into the volume's
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.031|                           corruption record and queued for the next spot-
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.032|                           fix, which is a seconds-long operation rather
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.033|                           than an hours-long one.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.034|    SPOTFIX              : chkdsk C: /spotfix. The companion operation: it
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.035|                           applies what a previous /scan queued. It does
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.036|                           need the volume briefly, so on the system drive
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.037|                           it takes a reboot, but seconds of it rather
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.038|                           than hours. OPTY does not offer this variant.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.039|    SKIP                 : Nothing runs. Windows keeps doing its own
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.040|                           continuous online self-healing through the Spot
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.041|                           Verifier service and the ProactiveScan
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.042|                           maintenance task, which is the shipped state.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.043|
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.044|  Why these profiles : Four identical RUN columns, because a read-only
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.045|                       integrity check has no downside that varies by use
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.046|                       case. The laptop stays RUN too: a few minutes of
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.047|                       metadata reads is not the battery event that a /r
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.048|                       surface scan would be. The Windows column is SKIP
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.049|                       because Windows genuinely does not run chkdsk /scan
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.050|                       on demand - its equivalent is the continuous
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.051|                       ProactiveScan work, which is already happening
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.052|                       whatever you answer here.
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.053|
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.054|  Target          : chkdsk %SystemDrive% /scan - OPTY.bat line 1256,
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.055|                    inside the :chkdsk label, reached from the :mchkdsk
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.056|                    menu option 1. Step id clean.chkdsk, declared __ in
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.057|                    the step table at OPTY.bat line 19136, meaning it runs
::X|EN|chkdsk.online.scan.058|                    in neither auto mode.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.001|  Ce que c est    : chkdsk C: /scan verifie les structures du systeme de
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.002|                    fichiers NTFS pendant que Windows tourne. Il ne
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.003|                    verrouille pas le volume, n exige aucun redemarrage et
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.004|                    ne repare rien sur le moment : il met les corruptions
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.005|                    trouvees en file pour la prochaine correction
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.006|                    ponctuelle.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.007|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.008|  Effet reel      : Lit et verifie. S il trouve des problemes, il les
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.009|                    inscrit dans le journal de corruption du volume ; s il
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.010|                    ne trouve rien, vous obtenez un rapport propre et rien
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.011|                    n est modifie.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.012|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.013|  Gain            : Vous apprenez si votre systeme de fichiers est sain,
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.014|                    et c est tout : c est un rapport, pas une reparation.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.015|                    Un resultat propre est ici le resultat attendu,
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.016|                    puisque Windows execute deja une auto-reparation
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.017|                    equivalente en continu via le service Spot Verifier et
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.018|                    la tache de maintenance ProactiveScan.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.019|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.020|  Cout            : Quelques minutes de temps et d acces disque. Rien
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.021|                    d autre, quel que soit le type de disque. Totalement
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.022|                    sans danger sur SSD : aucune analyse de surface,
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.023|                    aucune ecriture.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.024|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.025|  Defaut Windows  : Sans objet en tant que reglage - Windows assure de
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.026|                    lui-meme une auto-reparation en ligne permanente, et
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.027|                    cette etape ne configure rien.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.028|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.029|  Valeurs possibles :
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.030|    RUN                  : chkdsk C: /scan. Parcourt les metadonnees NTFS
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.031|                           en ligne, sans verrouiller le volume ni
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.032|                           redemarrer. Il ne repare rien sur le moment :
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.033|                           ce qu il trouve est inscrit dans le journal de
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.034|                           corruption du volume et mis en file pour la
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.035|                           prochaine correction ponctuelle, qui dure
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.036|                           quelques secondes et non des heures.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.037|    SPOTFIX              : chkdsk C: /spotfix. L operation complementaire
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.038|                           : elle applique ce qu un /scan precedent a mis
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.039|                           en file. Elle a besoin du volume un court
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.040|                           instant, donc sur le disque systeme elle passe
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.041|                           par un redemarrage, mais de quelques secondes
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.042|                           et non de plusieurs heures. OPTY ne propose pas
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.043|                           cette variante.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.044|    SKIP                 : Rien ne s execute. Windows poursuit sa propre
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.045|                           auto-reparation en ligne permanente via le
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.046|                           service Spot Verifier et la tache de
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.047|                           maintenance ProactiveScan, ce qui est l etat
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.048|                           livre.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.049|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.050|  Pourquoi ces profils : Quatre colonnes RUN identiques, parce qu un
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.051|                         controle d integrite en lecture seule n a aucun
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.052|                         inconvenient qui varie selon l usage. Le portable
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.053|                         reste a RUN lui aussi : quelques minutes de
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.054|                         lecture de metadonnees ne sont pas l evenement
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.055|                         pour la batterie que serait une analyse de
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.056|                         surface /r. La colonne Windows est a SKIP parce
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.057|                         que Windows ne lance vraiment pas chkdsk /scan a
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.058|                         la demande - son equivalent est le travail
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.059|                         continu de ProactiveScan, qui a lieu de toute
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.060|                         facon quelle que soit votre reponse.
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.061|
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.062|  Cible           : chkdsk %SystemDrive% /scan - OPTY.bat line 1256,
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.063|                    inside the :chkdsk label, reached from the :mchkdsk
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.064|                    menu option 1. Step id clean.chkdsk, declared __ in
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.065|                    the step table at OPTY.bat line 19136, meaning it runs
::X|FR|chkdsk.online.scan.066|                    in neither auto mode.
