::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.014|                    extra, and it is idle whenever no device is changing.
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.015|
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.016|  Windows default : 2 (Automatic).
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.017|
