::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.038|                           missing for the first minute after logon and
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.039|                           then appears, which reads as a fault. Not a
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.040|                           value Windows ships and not one to choose.
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.041|
::X|EN|svc.audioendpointbuilder.042|  Why these profiles : All five identical, including SERVER. Even a
