::X|FR|rp.point.create.055|                         la protection activee, repondre oui ne coute
::X|FR|rp.point.create.056|                         qu une minute et un peu d espace de cliches.
::X|FR|rp.point.create.057|
::X|FR|rp.point.create.058|  Non verifie (en)  : Whether System Protection ships on or off differs
::X|FR|rp.point.create.059|                      between a clean Windows 11 install and OEM images.
::X|FR|rp.point.create.060|                      OPTY enables it and never turns it back off - only
::X|FR|rp.point.create.061|                      the creation-frequency throttle is restored.
