:: ---- shutdown.machine (risky) ----------------------------------
::P|shutdown.machine|SKIP|SKIP|SKIP|SKIP|SKIP|
::T|EN|shutdown.machine.001|Shut the PC down when OPTY finishes
::T|EN|shutdown.machine.002|This force-closes every open program and powers off 15 seconds later with no save prompt, so only agree once you have closed everything yourself.
::T|FR|shutdown.machine.001|Éteindre le PC à la fin d OPTY
::T|FR|shutdown.machine.002|Cela ferme de force tous les programmes ouverts et éteint la machine 15 secondes plus tard sans proposer d enregistrer, donc ne répondez oui que si vous avez déjà tout fermé vous-même.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.001|  What it is      : Chains a power-off onto the end of the run, with
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.002|                    shutdown /s /f /t 15 - power off in 15 seconds,
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.003|                    forcing every application closed.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.004|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.005|  Actual effect   : Schedules the shutdown and waits. The /f flag kills
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.006|                    applications rather than asking them politely, so no
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.007|                    save prompt appears.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.008|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.009|  Gain            : Convenience: start a long cleanup, walk away, come
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.010|                    back to a powered-off machine. No technical benefit
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.011|                    whatsoever.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.012|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.013|  Cost            : Any unsaved document, open editor or in-progress
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.014|                    render is lost without warning. You have a 15-second
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.015|                    window to abort with shutdown /a in a command prompt.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.016|                    And if you scheduled a full CHKDSK earlier in this
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.017|                    run, it does NOT run now - it runs the next time you
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.018|                    power the machine on, and can hold it for hours before
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.019|                    Windows loads. Cancel a scheduled check with chkntfs
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.020|                    /x C: before shutting down if that is not what you
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.021|                    want.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.022|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.023|  Windows default : Not applicable.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.024|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.025|  Possible values:
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.026|    APPLY                : shutdown /s /f /t 15 is issued: power off in 15
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.027|                           seconds, /f meaning applications are killed
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.028|                           rather than asked to close, so nothing gets to
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.029|                           prompt you to save.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.030|    SKIP                 : OPTY returns to the menu and the machine stays
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.031|                           on. You shut it down yourself, whenever your
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.032|                           applications have actually saved.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.033|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.034|  Why these profiles : Five identical columns, and that is the honest
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.035|                       answer: this is not a setting, it is a request, and
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.036|                       no profile can know whether you are standing there
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.037|                       with a document open. The default is SKIP
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.038|                       everywhere because the cost is unrecoverable and
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.039|                       the gain is that you do not have to click Start
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.040|                       yourself. Answer yes only for the specific run
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.041|                       where you have closed everything and are walking
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.042|                       away.
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.043|
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.044|  Target          : :shutdown label, OPTY.bat 1349-1356 - shutdown /s /f
::X|EN|shutdown.machine.045|                    /t 15 followed by timeout /t 15 and exit
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.001|  Ce que c est    : Enchaine une extinction a la fin de l execution, via
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.002|                    shutdown /s /f /t 15 : extinction dans 15 secondes, en
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.003|                    fermant de force toutes les applications.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.004|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.005|  Effet reel      : Planifie l extinction et patiente. L option /f tue les
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.006|                    applications au lieu de le leur demander poliment :
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.007|                    aucune invite d enregistrement n apparait.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.008|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.009|  Gain            : Du confort : on lance un long nettoyage, on part, on
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.010|                    retrouve une machine eteinte. Aucun benefice
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.011|                    technique.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.012|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.013|  Cout            : Tout document non enregistre, editeur ouvert ou rendu
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.014|                    en cours est perdu sans avertissement. Vous avez 15
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.015|                    secondes pour annuler avec shutdown /a dans une invite
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.016|                    de commandes. Et si vous avez planifie un CHKDSK
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.017|                    complet plus tot dans cette execution, il ne tourne
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.018|                    PAS maintenant : il demarrera au prochain allumage et
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.019|                    peut monopoliser la machine des heures avant que
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.020|                    Windows ne charge. Annulez une verification planifiee
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.021|                    avec chkntfs /x C: avant d eteindre si ce n est pas ce
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.022|                    que vous voulez.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.023|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.024|  Defaut Windows  : Sans objet.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.025|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.026|  Valeurs possibles :
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.027|    APPLY                : shutdown /s /f /t 15 est lance : extinction
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.028|                           dans 15 secondes, /f signifiant que les
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.029|                           applications sont tuees et non invitees a se
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.030|                           fermer, donc rien ne peut vous proposer
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.031|                           d enregistrer.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.032|    SKIP                 : OPTY revient au menu et la machine reste
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.033|                           allumee. Vous l eteignez vous-meme, quand vos
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.034|                           applications ont reellement enregistre.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.035|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.036|  Pourquoi ces profils : Cinq colonnes identiques, et c est la reponse
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.037|                         honnete : ce n est pas un reglage mais une
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.038|                         demande, et aucun profil ne peut savoir si vous
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.039|                         etes devant l ecran avec un document ouvert. Le
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.040|                         defaut est SKIP partout parce que le cout est
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.041|                         irrattrapable et que le gain se resume a ne pas
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.042|                         cliquer sur Demarrer vous-meme. Repondez oui
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.043|                         seulement pour l execution precise ou vous avez
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.044|                         tout ferme et ou vous partez.
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.045|
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.046|  Cible           : :shutdown label, OPTY.bat 1349-1356 - shutdown /s /f
::X|FR|shutdown.machine.047|                    /t 15 followed by timeout /t 15 and exit
