:: ---- mo.prefetcher (repair) -------------------------------------
::P|mo.prefetcher|3|3|3|3|3|
::T|EN|mo.prefetcher.001|KEEP PREFETCHING ON (ENABLEPREFETCHER=3)
::T|EN|mo.prefetcher.002|Writes EnablePrefetcher=3, the Windows default, restoring boot and app-launch prefetch traces if another tool disabled them - no measurable gain on a healthy SSD machine, the point is putting an unknown machine into a known state.
::T|FR|mo.prefetcher.001|GARDER LE PREFETCH ACTIF (ENABLEPREFETCHER=3)
::T|FR|mo.prefetcher.002|Ecrit EnablePrefetcher=3, la valeur Windows d origine, retablissant les traces de prefetch au demarrage et au lancement des applications si un autre outil les avait coupees - aucun gain mesurable sur un PC SSD sain, le but est de remettre une machine inconnue dans un etat connu.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.001|  What it is      : Value 3 enables both application prefetch and boot
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.002|                    prefetch. This is the same write the restore path
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.003|                    makes, deliberately duplicated so the SETUP path
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.004|                    leaves the machine in the same known state.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.005|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.006|  Actual effect   : Writes 3 unconditionally, repairing machines where
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.007|                    another tool set 0 or 1, and rewriting the same number
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.008|                    on a machine that was never touched.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.009|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.010|  Gain            : Only on a machine where another tool set 0 or 1: boot
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.011|                    and app-launch tracing resume, which matters on a
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.012|                    mechanical disk. On a healthy SSD PC there is no
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.013|                    measurable gain - the point of the write is to put an
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.014|                    unknown machine into a known state.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.015|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.016|  Cost            : Nothing. A few MB of .pf files and a little disk
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.017|                    activity in the first seconds after boot.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.018|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.019|  Windows default : 3.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.020|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.021|  Possible values:
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.022|    3                    : Application prefetching and boot prefetching
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.023|                           both on - what Windows 11 installs. Launch
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.024|                           traces go to .pf files in C:\Windows\Prefetch,
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.025|                           and the boot trace feeds ReadyBoot.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.026|    2                    : Boot only. Application launch traces stop being
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.027|                           refreshed.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.028|    1                    : Applications only. The boot trace stops being
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.029|                           maintained, so ReadyBoot loses its ordering
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.030|                           data.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.031|    0                    : Off. What the 'no prefetch on SSD' advice
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.032|                           writes. It saves a few MB and some first-
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.033|                           seconds disk activity, and no measurement shows
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.034|                           it speeding anything up.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.035|    absent               : Windows 11 ships it present at 3, so absence
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.036|                           means a tool removed it and the memory manager
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.037|                           falls back to internal behaviour.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.038|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.039|  Why these profiles : Five identical threes, for the same reason as the
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.040|                       restore-path card: this is the Windows value and
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.041|                       prefetch behaviour does not vary by use case. The
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.042|                       old advice to disable prefetch on SSDs was never
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.043|                       supported by measurement.
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.044|
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.045|  Target          : reg add "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\C
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.046|                    ontrol\Session Manager\Memory
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.047|                    Management\PrefetchParameters" /v "EnablePrefetcher"
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.048|                    /t REG_DWORD /d 00000003 /f - written via :askreg
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.049|                    inside :setup_system. The same write is also performed,
::X|EN|mo.prefetcher.050|                    unasked, by :reassert_defaults.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.001|  Ce que c est    : La valeur 3 active a la fois le prefetch des
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.002|                    applications et celui du demarrage. C est la meme
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.003|                    ecriture que fait le chemin de restauration, dupliquee
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.004|                    volontairement pour que le chemin SETUP laisse la
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.005|                    machine dans le meme etat connu.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.006|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.007|  Effet reel      : Ecrit 3 sans condition, reparant les machines ou un
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.008|                    autre outil avait mis 0 ou 1, et reecrivant le meme
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.009|                    chiffre sur une machine jamais touchee.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.010|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.011|  Gain            : Uniquement sur une machine ou un autre outil avait mis
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.012|                    0 ou 1 : l enregistrement des traces de demarrage et
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.013|                    de lancement reprend, ce qui compte sur un disque
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.014|                    mecanique. Sur un PC SSD sain, aucun gain mesurable -
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.015|                    l ecriture sert a remettre une machine inconnue dans
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.016|                    un etat connu.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.017|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.018|  Cout            : Rien. Quelques Mo de fichiers .pf et un peu d activite
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.019|                    disque dans les premieres secondes apres le demarrage.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.020|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.021|  Defaut Windows  : 3.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.022|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.023|  Valeurs possibles :
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.024|    3                    : Prefetch des applications et prefetch du
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.025|                           demarrage tous deux actifs, ce qu installe
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.026|                           Windows 11. Les traces de lancement vont dans
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.027|                           les fichiers .pf de C:\Windows\Prefetch, et la
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.028|                           trace de demarrage alimente ReadyBoot.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.029|    2                    : Demarrage seul. Les traces de lancement
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.030|                           d applications cessent d etre rafraichies.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.031|    1                    : Applications seules. La trace de demarrage
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.032|                           n est plus entretenue, ReadyBoot perd ses
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.033|                           donnees d ordonnancement.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.034|    0                    : Desactive. Ce qu ecrit le conseil « pas de
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.035|                           prefetch sur SSD ». Cela economise quelques Mo
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.036|                           et un peu d activite disque dans les premieres
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.037|                           secondes, et aucune mesure ne montre
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.038|                           d acceleration.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.039|    absent               : Windows 11 la livre presente a 3 : son absence
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.040|                           signifie qu un outil l a retiree et que le
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.041|                           gestionnaire de memoire retombe sur son
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.042|                           comportement interne.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.043|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.044|  Pourquoi ces profils : Cinq fois 3, pour la meme raison que la fiche du
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.045|                         chemin de restauration : c est la valeur Windows
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.046|                         et le comportement du prefetch ne varie pas selon
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.047|                         l usage. Le vieux conseil de couper le prefetch
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.048|                         sur SSD n a jamais ete confirme par la mesure.
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.049|
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.050|  Cible           : reg add "HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\C
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.051|                    ontrol\Session Manager\Memory
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.052|                    Management\PrefetchParameters" /v "EnablePrefetcher"
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.053|                    /t REG_DWORD /d 00000003 /f - ecrit via :askreg dans
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.054|                    :setup_system. La meme ecriture est aussi faite, sans
::X|FR|mo.prefetcher.055|                    question, par :reassert_defaults.
