::P|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff|DELETE|DELETE|DELETE|DELETE|KEEP|
::T|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.001|LOCK THE RISKY CLEANUP CATEGORIES OFF
::T|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.002|Deletes nothing itself; it just makes sure Downloads, File History and your Windows rollback files cannot get swept up by the disk cleanup step, at no cost to you.
::T|FR|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.001|VERROUILLER LES CATÉGORIES DE NETTOYAGE RISQUÉES
::T|FR|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.002|Ne supprime rien lui même ; il empêche seulement Téléchargements, l Historique des fichiers et les fichiers de retour arrière Windows d être balayés par l étape de nettoyage, sans aucun coût.
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.001|  What it is      : Writes StateFlags0064 = 0 on 12 handlers, pinning them
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.002|                    explicitly OFF in the same profile 64 rather than
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.003|                    leaving them at whatever this machine already had.
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.004|
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.005|  Actual effect   : Marks these as not selected: BranchCache, Content
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.006|                    Indexer Cleaner, Device Driver Packages,
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.007|                    DownloadsFolder, Language Pack, Old ChkDsk Files,
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.008|                    Previous Installations, Temporary Setup Files, Update
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.009|                    Cleanup, Upgrade Discarded Files, User file versions,
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.010|                    Windows ESD installation files. Each write is guarded
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.011|                    by a reg query so handlers absent from this edition
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.012|                    are skipped. Nothing is deleted by these lines - they
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.013|                    are the brake, not the engine. Be aware that they run
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.014|                    back to back with the arming block and the sagerun in
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.015|                    a single :clean section behind one yes-or-no prompt,
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.016|                    so in the file as it stands you cannot answer this
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.017|                    step differently from the previous one.
