::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.052|                           the machine already carries. On a machine that
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.053|                           has had another cleaner or a previous profile
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.054|                           written to it, that can mean DownloadsFolder is
