::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.062|                           you anything you cannot get back another way.
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.063|
::X|EN|cl.cleanmgr.pinoff.064|  Why these profiles : Four DELETE and one KEEP. The four are identical
