::X|FR|cl.storagesense.setup.080|
::X|FR|cl.storagesense.setup.081|  Non verifie (en)  : The shipped values for 04, 2048 and 512 on a clean
::X|FR|cl.storagesense.setup.082|                      Windows 11 25H2 install were not verified; this
