::X|EN|cl.temp.windir.012|                    del deletes files, not folders, so the subdirectory
::X|EN|cl.temp.windir.013|                    tree survives and the folder still looks populated in
::X|EN|cl.temp.windir.014|                    Explorer afterwards even though it is empty of
::X|EN|cl.temp.windir.015|                    content.
