::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.076|
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.077|  Non verifie (en)  : The 11.2 MB and 240 byte figures come from one
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.078| measurement on the maintainer s machine. The general
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.079|                      shape - the populated iconcache files are open by
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.080|                      explorer.exe with no sharing - is how the shell
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.081| works, but the exact sizes are that machine s.
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.082|
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.083|  Cible           : OPTY.bat lines 988-1001. Line 989 still writes
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.084|                    "Deleting icon cache (thumbnails kept)" to the log;
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.085|                    lines 990-1001 are comments explaining why the del of 
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.086|                    %LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\Windows\Explorer\iconcache_*.
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.087|                    db was removed. There is no del, no rd and no reg
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.088|                    command left in this block. thumbcache_*.db was never
::X|FR|cl.iconcache.noop.089|                    targeted.
