::X|FR|cl.logs.cbspanther.066|  Non verifie (en)  : 93 MB of CbsPersist was measured once on the
::X|FR|cl.logs.cbspanther.067| maintainer s machine. Panther s size depends
::X|FR|cl.logs.cbspanther.068|                      entirely on how many in-place upgrades the machine
