:: ---- cl.driver.unpack (cleanup) ----------------------------------
::P|cl.driver.unpack|ASK|DELETE|DELETE|DELETE|KEEP|
::T|EN|cl.driver.unpack.001|LEFTOVER NVIDIA AND INTEL DRIVER INSTALL FILES
::T|EN|cl.driver.unpack.002|Removes the unpacked leftovers from NVIDIA and Intel driver installers, not the installed drivers themselves, which can free 1 to 3 GB on an NVIDIA machine, but if you kept an old package on purpose to roll back to, only a manual re-download gets it back.
::T|FR|cl.driver.unpack.001|RÉSIDUS DES INSTALLATEURS DE PILOTES NVIDIA ET INTEL
::T|FR|cl.driver.unpack.002|Supprime les fichiers laissés par les installateurs de pilotes NVIDIA et Intel après décompression, pas les pilotes installés eux mêmes, ce qui peut libérer 1 à 3 Go sur une machine NVIDIA, mais si vous aviez gardé un ancien paquet exprès pour y revenir, seul un retéléchargement manuel le ramène.
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.001|  What it is      : NVIDIA and Intel driver installers unpack themselves
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.002|                    to disk before installing and then leave the unpacked
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.003|                    copy behind. These are not the installed drivers -
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.004|                    removing them cannot uninstall anything and cannot
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.005|                    affect a running display driver. C:\AMD is
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.006|                    deliberately kept as a known-good fallback package.
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.007|
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.008|  Actual effect   : C:\NVIDIA is removed outright, folder and all. On the
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.009|                    Intel side only two folders are emptied,
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.010|                    C:\Intel\GfxCPLBatchFiles and C:\Intel\Logs - the
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.011|                    actual Intel unpack folder, C:\Intel\<package name>,
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.012|                    is not touched at all. On an AMD machine with no
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.013|                    C:\NVIDIA, and this is one, the step frees essentially
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.014|                    nothing and still logs a clean.
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.015|
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.016|  Gain            : On an NVIDIA machine, real: 1 to 3 GB per driver
::X|EN|cl.driver.unpack.017|                    version left behind, and the folders stack up because
