::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.090|                     hôtes WebView2 comme les Widgets ou le nouvel Outlook
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.091|                     tiennent généralement ces fichiers ouverts, donc ces
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.092|                     suppressions échouent la plupart du temps en silence.
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.093|
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.094|  Non verifie (en)  : Whether Edge is skipped in practice depends on its
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.095|                      startup-boost and background-apps settings, which
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.096|                      vary by install and by policy - the mechanism is
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.097|                      certain, the frequency on your machine is not. The
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.098|                      per-profile size range is from ordinary installs;
::X|FR|cl.browser.caches.099|                      the only figure actually measured here is 28 MB of
