::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.065|                         PORTABLE sans Steam, la lecture du registre ne
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.066|                         trouve rien et l étape sort immédiatement.
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.067|                         WINDOWS veut dire ne touchez à rien, ce qui vous
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.068|                         coûte deux ou trois cents Mo et rien d autre.
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.069|
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.070|  Non verifie (en)  : 141 MB of htmlcache was measured once on this
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.071|                      machine. Log and dump sizes vary with how much Steam
::X|FR|cl.steam.cache.072|                      has crashed and were not measured. Whether steam.exe
