::X|FR|cl.ubisoft.cache.063|
::X|FR|cl.ubisoft.cache.064|  Non verifie (en)  : That clearing this cache can cost you a sign-in
::X|FR|cl.ubisoft.cache.065|                      comes from user reports and Ubisoft support threads
