::X|FR|cl.ubisoft.cache.067|                      the launcher keeps in that folder is what makes it
::X|FR|cl.ubisoft.cache.068|                      plausible. The 50 to 300 MB range is typical for an
::X|FR|cl.ubisoft.cache.069|                      account with several games, not a measurement of
