::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.017|                    C:\Users\compt\AppData\Local\Origin\Logs and the
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.018|                    Roaming equivalent are absent, and
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.019|                    C:\ProgramData\Origin totals 0 MB. Real recovery here
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.020|                    is 0 bytes. On a PC still running Origin, the logs are
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.021|                    a few MB, rarely above 20 MB.
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.022|
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.023|  Cost            : None. Logs are rewritten on the next launch. No
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.024|                    entitlement, no setting, no save is in the path.
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.025|
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.026|  Windows default : Not applicable - third-party application logs. Windows
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.027|                    ships nothing here and never cleans it.
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.028|
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.029|  Possible values:
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.030|    DELETE               : Empty the three Origin Logs folders. Costs
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.031|                           nothing and can break nothing, because no path
