::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.038|                           worth making; deleting a log file that Origin
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.039|                           rewrites on its own is not one.
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.040|
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.041|  Why these profiles : Four identical columns, and that is the honest
::X|EN|cl.origin.logs.042|                       answer: nothing about latency, throughput or
