::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.043|                       DELETE because absent is the factory state.
::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.044|
::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.045|  Known problems  : The empty Serialize key is not removed after the value
::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.046|                    is deleted, so the restore is functionally but not
