::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.048|
::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.049|  Unverified      : That the stagger makes the desktop usable sooner is a
::X|EN|cl.startupdelay.restore.050|                    mechanism, not a measurement. It is credible on a
